sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Flutter)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant ID as Identity Service
    participant DB as Identity DB
    participant OP as Outbox Publisher
    participant K as Kafka
    participant NS as Notification Service

    U->>GW: POST /public/identity/sign-up
    GW->>ID: Proxy public request
    ID->>DB: INSERT user + verification_token
    ID->>DB: INSERT outbox_event
    ID-->>U: 201 Created

    OP->>DB: Poll pending outbox_event
    OP->>K: Publish identity.email.verification.requested
    K-->>NS: Deliver event
    NS->>NS: Check processed_event
    NS->>NS: Send verification email
    NS-->>K: Commit offset

    U->>GW: GET /public/identity/verify-email?token=...
    GW->>ID: Proxy verify request
    ID->>DB: Mark token used + user verified
    ID-->>U: Verification result
